OL,3,GNEWSAConsultation launched for car
OL,4,Aparking charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has launched a consultation
OL,7,Fon plans to potentially introduce
OL,8,Fcharges at car parks across two towns.
OL,10,FThe Reform UK-led North
OL,11,FNorthamptonshire Council has proposed
OL,12,Fbringing in fees at 49 car parks in
OL,13,FWellingborough and Rushden.
OL,15,FThe council said the plans would create
OL,16,Fa consistent approach and ensure its
OL,17,Fcar parks cover their own costs, but
OL,18,Fthat no decision has been taken yet.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
